# English identifiers (mandatory)

Before creating or editing any file in this project, follow `.cursor/skills/english-code-identifiers/SKILL.md`.

- **English only**: filenames, folders, variables, functions, classes, modules, API paths/keys, DB names, env keys, code comments, commits.
- **Spanish allowed only** in user-visible UI / guest-facing copy.
- **Never commit** probe/debug test scripts under `scripts/probe_*` or `scripts/debug_*`.
